Implemented `web-tests` directly in the repository with focused coverage across data, domain, and frontend logic, plus CI wiring for web tests.

### What changed

- Added full request-contract tests for web data services:
  - [room-http.service.spec.ts](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/kiubo-web/src/app/data/http/room-http.service.spec.ts)
    - Covers all `RoomHTTPService` requests (`GET/PUT/PATCH`, URL/params/headers, blob endpoints).
  - [user-http.service.spec.ts](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/kiubo-web/src/app/data/http/user-http.service.spec.ts)
    - Covers all `UserHTTPService` requests, multipart upload, and `verifyToken` success/failure behavior.

- Added domain tests:
  - [room-mapper.service.spec.ts](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/kiubo-web/src/app/domain/mappers/room-mapper.service.spec.ts)
    - Verifies fallback naming, rename mapping, and score aggregation/sorting logic.
  - [user.service.spec.ts](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/kiubo-web/src/app/domain/services/user.service.spec.ts)
    - Verifies mapped success path, empty-view error, and unauthorized/logout handling.

- Added frontend logic tests:
  - [room-list.component.spec.ts](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/kiubo-web/src/app/ui/dashboard/room-list/room-list.component.spec.ts)
    - Covers selection toggles, empty-state emission, archive success flow, and PDF download behavior.

- Added workflow execution of web tests:
  - [.github/workflows/kiubo-pr-validate.yml](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/.github/workflows/kiubo-pr-validate.yml)
    - Detects `kiubo-web/**` changes (excluding dist folders) and runs new `web-test` job.
  - [.github/workflows/kiubo-web-package.yml](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/.github/workflows/kiubo-web-package.yml)
    - Runs web tests before packaging builds.

- Added CI-friendly browser launcher:
  - [karma.conf.js](/private/var/folders/1c/w39zm2x92fz933tpv8rl3sdm0000gn/T/kiubo-automation-worktrees/kiubo-app/web-tests/kiubo-web/karma.conf.js)
    - Added `ChromeHeadlessCI` custom launcher with `--no-sandbox` and `--disable-dev-shm-usage`.

